check 1
# Smashing the Mephisto soulstone on the Hellforge (quests-act4.md §4.6):
# ScnAm4 (Act IV start) with quests 25.0 27.2 27.3, -seed 1234. Pokes: warp
# 107 and walk to the forge (goto preset), an `mss ` on the ground picked up
# (0x16, to the inventory) and put on the forge (`operate`, mode 0 -> 1 ->
# 2), an `hfh ` picked up to the cursor and swapped onto the weapon hand
# (0x16, 0x1D), then three `operate` hits: mode 3, 27.1 and 27.13, gems.
# Compares the forge's mode, the quest flags and the dropped items.
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name a4-hellforge-smash
save ScnAm4 --class ama --expansion --act 3 --quests acts=3 --quests 25.0 --quests 27.2 --quests 27.3
seed 1234
ticks 330
seconds 1200
channels state
at 5 poke warp 107
at 20 poke goto preset 107 2:376
at 70 poke item mss @x+2 @y
at 75 poke msg 0x16 4 @4 0
at 80 poke operate @2:376
at 160 poke item hfh @x+2 @y
at 170 poke msg 0x16 4 @4 1
at 175 poke msg 0x1D @4 4
at 190 poke operate @2:376
at 200 poke operate @2:376
at 210 poke operate @2:376
